      "text": "A full day on the Argentine side of Iguazu National Park, with its three main trails: the Lower Circuit, deep in the rainforest close to falls such as Dos Hermanas, Bossetti and Álvar Núñez; the Upper Circuit, along elevated walkways above several waterfalls; and the Devil’s Throat, reached by the Ecological Train and a walk, where observation platforms reveal the immense power of the water plunging into the gorge.",
